  m_Name: Order_D-4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: BilgiAdasi::BilgiAdasi.Order.OrderTask
  taskId: D-4
  title: "Y\u0131k\u0131k K\xF6pr\xFC"
  residentName: "Duvarc\u0131 Halil"
  requestLine: "Har\xE7 i\xE7in s\xF6nm\xFC\u015F kire\xE7 laz\u0131m. Kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131
    var ama. Ustan ta\u015Ftan kire\xE7 \xE7\u0131kar\u0131rd\u0131, iki ad\u0131mda.
    Acele etme."
  reminderLine: "\xD6nce ta\u015Ftan kire\xE7, sonra kire\xE7ten har\xE7. \u0130ki
    ad\u0131m, \xE7\u0131rak."
  deliverLine: "Tam k\u0131vam\u0131nda. \xC7\u0131ra\u011F\u0131 ustas\u0131n\u0131
    aratm\u0131yor."
  afterLine: "K\xF6pr\xFC ta\u015F gibi oldu. Art\u0131k arabalar da ge\xE7er."
  hint: "Her denklem katsay\u0131 istemez. Saymadan kavanoz ekleme."
  realLife: "Kire\xE7 s\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCl\xFCrken \xE7ok \u0131s\u0131 \xE7\u0131kar
    ve kire\xE7 cilde, g\xF6ze zarar verir; ustalar eldiven ve g\xF6zl\xFCk takar."
  reasoning:
    question: "Kire\xE7 ta\u015F\u0131n\u0131n i\xE7indeki karbon nereye gitti?"
    options:
    - "CO<sub>2</sub> olarak havaya kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131; atomlar\u0131 kaybolmad\u0131,
      ba\u015Fka bir maddede."
    - "Is\u0131yla yan\u0131p yok oldu."
    - "CaO'nun i\xE7inde sakl\u0131 duruyor."
    correctIndex: 0
    replies:
    - "Aynen \xF6yle. Ne girerse o \xE7\u0131kar: karbon ta\u015Ftan havaya ge\xE7ti."
    - "Hi\xE7bir atom yok olmaz, \xE7\u0131rak. Karbon CO<sub>2</sub>'nin i\xE7inde
      havaya kar\u0131\u015Ft\u0131."
    - "CaO'ya bak: i\xE7inde Ca ve O var, karbon yok. Karbon CO<sub>2</sub> ile \xE7\u0131kt\u0131."
  discoveryId: K-4
  discoveryText: "Bir tepkimenin \xFCr\xFCn\xFC ba\u015Fka bir tepkimenin gireni
    olabilir (ara \xFCr\xFCn). Kire\xE7: CaCO<sub>3</sub> \u2192 CaO \u2192 Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub>."
